{
  "id": "ZEC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Sekaria 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tun iweegu Jehovah bikyik che kigoiyesta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osom Jehovah ropta eng’ betusiek che bo ropta ne bo let, Jehovah ne yaei kalyelosiek; si kogochi ichek ropta ne inesi, ak kogochi chi age tugul suswek eng’ emet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kigomwa terapik tangoita, ak kigogeer bik che ng’orsei lembechek, ak kigomwa ichek karuotitaosiek che bo lembech, igoigoisiei buch; bendoti ko u kechirek, kinyalili amu matinyei mestowot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerekyini mestowek, ak abire kwesik: amu karutochi Jehovah ne bo lugosiek akwennyi ne bo kechirek, gotab Juda, ak koyai ichek koigei mbartanyinnyi ne mie eng’ boriet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mong’une inendet koita ne bo luita, mong’une inendet kipchumariat, mong’une inendet kwangetab boriet, mong’une inendet age tugul ne usisiei kibagenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koigei bik che nyigonen, che tiechei bunikwak eng’ ng’atatekab ortinwek eng’ boriet; ak kobargei, amu mi Jehovah koboto ichek: ak kotoptobenso bik che lanyei mbartanyisiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agimit gotab Juda, ak asoru gotab Josep, ak amutu ichek kogeny, amu arire ichek; ak koigei ye kima amete ichek: amu a Jehovah Kamuktaindenywa, ak agas ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koigei ichek che bo Epraim chito ne nyigan, ak koboiboitu mugulelwekwak ko u che kaeei divaik: ee, keerei lagokwok noto, ak koboiboitu; igasegei mugulelwekwak eng’ Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aititenjini ichek, ak ayum, amu kiatiach ichek: ak kotesogis ko u ye kiga kotesogis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agol ichek eng’ kwenutab bororiosiek; ak kobwata komi emotinwek che looen: ak komeng’is koboto lagokwak, ak koweeigei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutu ichek kogeny komong’une emetab Misri, ak ayum ichek komong’ eng’ Asuria; ak amutu ichek kobwa emetab Gilead ak Lebanon; ama biitu ole yamei ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak beek che mildogei eng’ nyanjet, ak kotenyo rirosiek tugul che bo Nael: ak kiming’in menotetab Asuria, ak koistogei siaritab Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agimit ichek eng’ Jehovah; ak kobendate kainennyi, mwaei Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
